  "comments": [
    {"at":0,"placement":"line","text":"Adds the score value of scoring_move (half for a half point) to bout_hit_value of fighter X, the tie-break at time up. Called by bout_1p_exchanges."},
    {"at":5,"placement":"side","text":"Bug: reads hit_points of fighter 0 also when X is 1."},
    {"at":18,"placement":"line","text":"Writes 30 into the clock digits at $cc3b. Called before each bout."},
    {"at":29,"placement":"line","text":"Writes 1 PLAYER or 2 PLAYER at $ccbf for two_player_mode. Called by the title loop and the F3 key."},
    {"at":60,"placement":"line","text":"Unused old routine: LDA #$20 and four STA $cca0-$cca3, RTS. It erases DEMO; clear_rank_text erases 8 characters in its place."},
    {"at":75,"placement":"line","text":"Writes DEMO at $cca0, the place of the rank text. Called by demo_play."},
    {"at":96,"placement":"line","text":"Waits X times 6 frames: it counts passes of raster line $fe. Called by time_bonus_count."},
    {"at":119,"placement":"line","text":"After a one-player win: counts the clock down second by second and adds 100 points per second, with a 6-frame pause. Called by bout_1p_exchanges."},
    {"at":123,"placement":"side","text":"Runs the clock without a frame wait up to the next whole second."},
    {"at":147,"placement":"line","text":"Writes the rank X at text_dest_ptr: 0 NOVICE, 1-9 the digit with ST, ND, RD or TH and DAN, 10 the text 10TH DAN. Called by game_one_player."},
    {"at":170,"placement":"side","text":"Digit = rank + $30; a rank above 9 gives another character."},
    {"at":267,"placement":"line","text":"Fills the 8 cells of the rank text at $cca0 with spaces. Called at the start of each mode."},
    {"at":278,"placement":"line","text":"Rank texts in the ASCII order of the panel characters. NOVICE has 7 characters, with a space."},
    {"at":293,"placement":"line","text":"Rank number of each rank index: 0, 1-10, 10. Only 12 entries; the rank index goes up to 22, so ranks 12-22 read the code of ai_update."}
  ],
